WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.030
The ROWS frame counts ordered rows Two preceding
means up to two earlier

00:00:06.057 --> 00:00:11.586
rows It does not mean two days two hours or two
months unless every

00:00:11.613 --> 00:00:17.390
time unit has exactly one row This distinction
matters when the sequence

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:18.140
has gaps
